### 6. Update Global DNS

> **Applies to:** ALL

Update Global DNS to point to the new cluster.

- **Repo:** [cpp-terraform-network](https://github.com/hmcts/cpp-terraform-network)
- **Example PR:** [Commit](https://github.com/hmcts/cpp-terraform-network/commit/8014ee1d57307a587d5c09f525247c6bc6b2e648)
- **Pipeline:** [Network Pipeline](https://dev.azure.com/hmcts-cpp/cpp-apps/_build?definitionId=54)
  - **Environment:** mdv (or mpd)

Additionally check the environment tfvars for the cluster you are working on. Ensure any explicit vnet peerings are also updated to target the new cluster network. [An example from SIT](https://github.com/hmcts/cpp-terraform-network/blob/main/vars/sit.tfvars#L73-L79). The Resource Group and Virtual Network will need updating (from 02 to 01 or vice vera)

