### 14. Enable Cost Analysis

> **Applies to:** ALL

Cost analysis is required until Terraform support is available.

```bash
az aks update --resource-group <cluster-rg> --name <cluster> --enable-cost-analysis
```

Verify the pod is running:

```bash
kubectl get deploy cost-analysis-agent -n kube-system
```
If the pod stays hung on 'pending' status, its likely the PVC is being rejected by Azure policy for tagging. Review the exceptions and add the relevant resources to the exceptions list. [An example for SIT](https://github.com/hmcts/cpp-azure-policy/pull/103/changes)

